From: Smart AP firmware project
Subject: [PATCH] nl80211: treat hostapd multi_ap zero as fronthaul-only

hostapd reports multi_ap=0 for an untagged access point. This is a valid
existing AP and is equivalent to fronthaul-only for discovery purposes.

--- a/common/beerocks/bwl/nl80211/base_wlan_hal_nl80211.cpp
+++ b/common/beerocks/bwl/nl80211/base_wlan_hal_nl80211.cpp
@@ -843,6 +843,7 @@ bool base_wlan_hal_nl80211::refresh_vaps_info(int id)
             vap_element.backhaul  = true;
             break;
+        case 0:
         case beerocks::eBssType::BSS_TYPE_FRONTHAUL:
             vap_element.fronthaul = true;
             vap_element.backhaul  = false;
